                                "sense_id": "4556c9b4-acbe-3afe-a57f-b005528669b8",
                                "text": "He proposed a bicameral legislature divided into elected legislators tasked with everyday business of state, who he called “telothetes,” and another set of legislators called “nomothetes” of ages forty to fifty-five elected by their peers to fifteen-year terms."
                            }
                        ]
